<title>USA: Tekelec names Toomer president.</title>
<headline>Tekelec names Toomer president.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tekelec said that Allan Toomer was named president and elected to the board of directors.</p>
<p>Toomer, presently senior vice president and general manager of the company's network switching division, replaces current president Philip Alford, who has resigned from that post and from the board of directors effective immediately.</p>
<p>Alford also resigned as chief executive officer effective December 31. Tekelec said Toomer will continue to act as general manager of the network switching division while it recruits a successor.</p>
</text>
